      "title": "Discarding a draft that does not read back as a case",
      "summary": "The backend accepts a discard of a draft version whichever validator rule fails over it, with draft state as the only condition."
    },
    {
      "id": "epic/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid",
      "kind": "epic",
      "file": "epic/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid.md",
      "title": "Correcting a draft on the editor while it does not read back as a case",
